  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 53c562d8de26bab4e987f7b49b422ce5, type: 3}
  m_Name: '[InteractiveObject]AcademyGateOpen'
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::RPGCreationKit.InteractiveObject
  Name: Academy Gate
  Action: Enter
  Description: 'You come in waaay too late...

    The humming chant of the sacred
    ritual of renewal, which ends all major academy functions is interrupted unceremoniously
    as you creak the old gate open.

    The faculty of archmages filling the great
    hall who have been instructing you to their best for years all turn their heads
    towards you in dissapointed shock. Their eyes scream: "You did not just fail
    to graduate, this failure cost you any and all reputation you might have still
    had in Urgencia."



    Too bad it had to end this way.'
  InteractiveOptions: 02000000
  openUIEvenWithOneOption: 1
